  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-codegraph",
      "text": "`dsh-codegraph` is a question-driven code explanation plugin for DeepSeek Harness. The main agent delegates read-only investigation to a continuable child and presents a focused, evidence-backed architecture scene in better-sidebar."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-codegraph",
      "text": "The model submits only `dsh-codegraph.scene.v1` JSON. The plugin owns validation, persistence, fixed React components, and deterministic layout. Node names, relationships, and one-line takeaways stay visible; scene notes, fuller explanations, evidence paths, and line ranges expand on demand. The sidebar is a viewer—not a second chat or a free-form diagram editor.\n\nCompatibility target: DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-alpha.1` and better-sidebar `0.17.1`."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-codegraph",
      "text": "See [README.zh-CN.md](./README.zh-CN.md) for the full product boundary and development commands."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-codegraph",
      "text": "`dsh-codegraph` 是 DeepSeek Harness 的问题驱动代码解释插件。它让主智能体在图比文字更清楚时，委派一个只读、可续接的调查子智能体，并在 better-sidebar 中展示一张有焦点、可核查的代码架构图。"
    },
    {
      "section": "产品边界",
      "text": "- 一张图回答一个具体问题，默认突出 5–10 个节点，硬上限 30 个节点。\n- 节点名称、关系与一句主旨默认可见；图说明、完整解释、证据路径和代码行号按需展开。\n- 模型只提交 `dsh-codegraph.scene.v1` JSON；组件、样式和布局由插件固定实现。\n- 用户继续在主对话提问；侧栏没有第二个输入框，也不是自由画布编辑器。\n- Host 校验仓库边界和证据行，完整 Scene 不进入主智能体上下文。\n- 不持续监听仓库重绘，也不建立独立 HTTP 或 WebSocket 服务。\n\n当前兼容目标：DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-alpha.1` 与 better-sidebar `0.17.1`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run typecheck\npnpm test\npnpm run build\n\nalpha.1 的 DSH 子包尚未发布到 npm，本仓库的开发依赖会链接同级 `deepseek-harness` 源码；发布包只保留兼容 peer 范围。"
    }
  ],
